sequenceDiagram
    participant Queue as Channel queue
    participant Worker as Gateway worker loop
    participant Identity as Identity and persona resolution
    participant Core as Core dispatcher
    participant Data as Data-access APIs
    participant LLM as LLM adapter/service
    participant Tool as Approved tool subprocess
    participant Recorder as Signal recorder

    Worker->>Queue: claim inbound turn
    Queue-->>Worker: bound peer, bot account, message
    Worker->>Identity: resolve binding and persona owner
    alt authorized user and owned persona
      Identity-->>Worker: user_id, persona_slug
      Worker->>Core: dispatch turn
      Core->>Data: scoped memory and active approved tool manifest
      Data-->>Core: context and tool definitions
      Core->>LLM: policy, context, latest message, approved tools
      LLM-->>Core: response or selected tool call
      alt pure/read approved tool
        Core->>Data: verify active version and checksum
        Core->>Tool: execute selected approved tool
        Tool-->>Core: result
        Core->>Recorder: record outcome
        Core-->>Worker: final reply
        Worker->>Queue: enqueue reply and acknowledge inbound
      else mutate approved tool
        Core->>Data: persist pending approval with exact version and arguments
        Core-->>Worker: pause turn and show exact effects
        Worker->>Queue: enqueue confirmation request and acknowledge inbound
        Note over Queue,Worker: Later confirmation is a new queued inbound message.
        Worker->>Queue: claim owner confirmation
        Worker->>Identity: recheck same bound peer and persona owner
        Worker->>Core: resume saved request
        Core->>Data: atomically claim if confirmed, unexpired, and version active
        alt claim succeeds
          Core->>Tool: execute saved arguments once
          Tool-->>Core: result
          Core->>Recorder: record outcome
          Core-->>Worker: resumed reply
          Worker->>Queue: enqueue reply and acknowledge confirmation
        else rejected, expired, changed, or uncertain
          Core-->>Worker: report status without execution
          Worker->>Queue: acknowledge confirmation
        end
      else unknown or unapproved tool
        Core-->>Worker: reject call without subprocess
        Worker->>Queue: enqueue error and acknowledge inbound
      end
    else missing binding or persona mismatch
      Identity-->>Worker: binding_missing or persona_access_denied
      Worker->>Queue: dead-letter inbound without core dispatch
    end
    Note over Core,Recorder: Only core drives signal recording.
